                                                "sense_id": "5637a365-0501-3294-8235-df3d639ac3e2",
                                                "text": "DeMaio's problem with the resolution is in part related to the section calling out various anti-LBGTQ+ bills, which reads: \"The aforementioned anti-LGBTQ+ bills disproportionately target TGI people and include efforts to prohibit access to lifesaving gender-affirming health care, […]"
